  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "1 Samuel",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 12,
    "summary": "Samuel testifies of his own just dealings in Israel—He reproves the people for their ingratitude—He exhorts them to keep the commandments lest the Lord consume them and their king.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And Samuel said unto all Israel, Behold, I have hearkened unto your voice in all that ye said unto me, and have made a king over you.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 12:1",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, behold, the king walketh before you: and I am old and grayheaded; and, behold, my sons are with you: and I have walked before you from my childhood unto this day.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 121,
            "end": 127,
            "text": "Mosiah 2:12 (9–41)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 99
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 12:2",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, here I am: witness against me before the Lord, and before his anointed: whose ox have I taken? or whose ass have I taken? or whom have I defrauded? whom have I oppressed? or of whose hand have I received any bribe to blind mine eyes therewith? and I will restore it you.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 145,
            "end": 154,
            "text": "TG Fraud."
          },
          {
            "start": 216,
            "end": 221,
            "text": "TG Bribe."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 18
          },
          {
            "start": 212,
            "end": 215
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
